Let's talk about impedance.

16:28.540 --> 16:35.420
Anyone who has ever bought a speaker or a pair of high-end headphones has seen an impedance rating, usually measured in ohms.

16:36.680 --> 16:40.780
In standard circuit theory, impedance is just the relationship between voltage and current.

16:41.320 --> 16:42.840
